  "title": "Low-Carb Bacon Cheeseburger Casserole",
  "description": "This low-carb cheeseburger casserole is creamy and satisfying with all your burger favorites (beef, Cheddar, and bacon) but it leaves the buns behind!",
  "authors": [
    "Alexis Redden"
  ],
